---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
const lang = 'en';
---
<PageLayout title="Inquiry Next Steps" description="How to check and follow up on your inquiry" lang={lang} heroTitle="Inquiry Next Steps" heroSubtitle="How to check and follow up on your inquiry">
  <section class="section-padding"><div class="container-wide max-w-3xl">
    <div class="bg-off-white rounded-xl p-8 space-y-5">
      <p class="text-gray-600">Thank you for considering ZL Botanicals. This is a public static page that anyone can visit; it does not confirm that a form was sent or an email reached the inbox.</p><p class="text-gray-600">If you just used FormSubmit, complete any verification steps it requests. Form processing, mailbox activation and email delivery depend on that third-party service; this website cannot check delivery status.</p><p class="text-gray-600">To check an inquiry or follow up if you have not heard back, email directly with the date of your original inquiry, the ingredient and your requirements. Response timing depends on the inquiry; no fixed reply time is promised here.</p>
      <a href="mailto:info@zlbotanicals.com" class="inline-block text-primary underline break-all">info@zlbotanicals.com</a>
    </div>
    <a href="/contact" class="inline-block mt-8 px-6 py-3 bg-primary text-white rounded-lg">Return to contact page</a>
  </div></section>
</PageLayout>
